knowledge for generations.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"The worn, wooden desks and creaky chairs in the lecture halls seemed to whisper stories of the countless students who had sat in them, eager to absorb the wisdom of their professors.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"Soo-Sum's thoughts were interrupted by the arrival of her colleague, Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"Amr Hassan, who plopped down beside her, his eyes red from lack of sleep.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"\\\"Soo-Sum, I think I've found something,\\\" he said, his voice laced with excitement.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"\\\"The latest batch of test results suggests that our theory about the disease's vector might be correct.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"Together, they pored over the data, their conversation punctuated by the sound of scribbling notes and the occasional ring of a phone in the background.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"As they worked, the sounds of the medical school – the beeping of machines, the murmur of students in the library, and the occasional wail of a siren outside – created a symphony that was both familiar and comforting.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"In this moment, Soo-Sum felt grateful to be a part of the Zagazig University Faculty of Human Medicine, where the pursuit of knowledge and the passion for healing came together in a beautiful dance.\"}]}"
